        "detailed_description": "<h1>about me</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facebook：@gamefpscom </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitter：@gamefpscom</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak not of love untouched by passion's fire, as it's a torturous journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If lovers would remain faithful evermore,On Peony Pavilion’s road they’ll meet for three lives more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Bride 7: Lethal Bond is a Chinese horror puzzle game, and the 7th title of the Paper Bride series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, we follow a new protagonist seeking his suddenly-departed lover in a mysterious town that treads between two realms. On this eerie trip, in addition to the addition of Qingqing and Tongtong from Paper Bride 3: Mandarin Pact, many familiar faces also make their return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our latest title continues to break new grounds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Folk Culture Enhancement — Featuring the same beloved traditional folklore elements fans have come to expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Storyline Expansion — Beloved characters from the Paper Bride universe return in meaningful roles, not merely as Easter eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Visual Refinement — Everything is heightened: beauty becomes more breathtaking, handsomeness more striking, ugliness more disturbing, and strangeness more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Suspense Intensification — Veterans may be numb to our scares by now, but we still recommend playing before bedtime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We thank everyone for your continued love and support for the Paper Bride series! We've always wanted our stories to present a Chinese, folk-inspired world to our players. In this latest title, you'll not only be immersed in a tapestry of rich folklore and customs, but also a torrent of paper creatures, surprises, and scares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to have your heebies be jeebied in Paper Bride 7!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak not of love untouched by passion's fire, as it's a torturous journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If lovers would remain faithful evermore,On Peony Pavilion’s road they’ll meet for three lives more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Bride 7: Lethal Bond is a Chinese horror puzzle game, and the 7th title of the Paper Bride series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, we follow a new protagonist seeking his suddenly-departed lover in a mysterious town that treads between two realms. On this eerie trip, in addition to the addition of Qingqing and Tongtong from Paper Bride 3: Mandarin Pact, many familiar faces also make their return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our latest title continues to break new grounds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Folk Culture Enhancement — Featuring the same beloved traditional folklore elements fans have come to expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Storyline Expansion — Beloved characters from the Paper Bride universe return in meaningful roles, not merely as Easter eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Visual Refinement — Everything is heightened: beauty becomes more breathtaking, handsomeness more striking, ugliness more disturbing, and strangeness more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Suspense Intensification — Veterans may be numb to our scares by now, but we still recommend playing before bedtime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We thank everyone for your continued love and support for the Paper Bride series! We've always wanted our stories to present a Chinese, folk-inspired world to our players. In this latest title, you'll not only be immersed in a tapestry of rich folklore and customs, but also a torrent of paper creatures, surprises, and scares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to have your heebies be jeebied in Paper Bride 7!</p>",
        "short_description": "Speak not of love untouched by passion's fire, as it's a torturous journey.  If lovers would remain faithful evermore,On Peony Pavilion’s road they’ll meet for three lives more. Paper Bride 7: Lethal Bond is a Chinese horror puzzle game, and the 7th title of the Paper Bride series.",
